<title>GERMANY: Siemens seeks control of Italtel.</title>
<headline>Siemens seeks control of Italtel.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Siemens AG is seeking a majority stake over the long term in Italian telecommunications firm Italtel, the head of Siemens' public networks group Peter Pribilla said on Friday.</p>
<p>Pribilla told reporters that Siemens was interested in a majority stake in British telecoms company GPT Ltd, which is active in southeast Asia.</p>
<p>Siemens now owns 50 percent of Italtel and 40 percent of GPT.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
